/T (Computer Society of India MJCET and E-Cell MJCET organized their first pre-hackathon workshop named "StackSprint: A Web development adventure" which was a two-day workshop which was held on the 10th and 11th of November, Friday, and Saturday at CIC Lab from 9:30 am to 4 pm. This workshop was intended to provide an in-depth knowledge of Web Development. The workshop proved to be an insightful one for the 70+ attendees and offered them an opportunity to have a gateway into web development.)
/E (Computer Society of India MJCET and E-Cell MJCET organized their first pre-hackathon workshop named "StackSprint: A Web development adventure" which was a two-day workshop which was held on the 10th and 11th of November, Friday, and Saturday at CIC Lab from 9:30 am to 4 pm. This workshop was intended to provide an in-depth knowledge of Web Development. The workshop proved to be an insightful one for the 70+ attendees and offered them an opportunity to have a gateway into web development.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
