638 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (but they have the potential to revolutionize the way people interact with technology. The major use case so far has been to help people with disabilities communicate and control prosthetics or other devices. In the current state of technology, Brain-Computer Interfaces \(BCIs\) are an intriguing new development. By serving as a link between the human brain and computers, these interfaces enable users to operate devices solely with their thoughts. Our brains are amazing machines that control all of our emotions and actions. One of the main components of BCIs, brain stimulation, for example, can selectively activate neural pathways to improve memory and change behavior patterns. It's similar to optimizing the circuitry in the brain to function at its best. )
/E (but they have the potential to revolutionize the way people interact with technology. The major use case so far has been to help people with disabilities communicate and control prosthetics or other devices. In the current state of technology, Brain-Computer Interfaces \(BCIs\) are an intriguing new development. By serving as a link between the human brain and computers, these interfaces enable users to operate devices solely with their thoughts. Our brains are amazing machines that control all of our emotions and actions. One of the main components of BCIs, brain stimulation, for example, can selectively activate neural pathways to improve memory and change behavior patterns. It's similar to optimizing the circuitry in the brain to function at its best. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
