<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Additionally, FL isn't limited to virtual keyboards, this was one instance. It's being used in various applications like auto-completion, item recommendation, healthcare applications, and IoT devices. This versatile approach to collaborative learning opens doors to new possibilities across different industries.)
/E (Additionally, FL isn't limited to virtual keyboards, this was one instance. It's being used in various applications like auto-completion, item recommendation, healthcare applications, and IoT devices. This versatile approach to collaborative learning opens doors to new possibilities across different industries.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
