/T (faculty of the best kind of the Department ensuring quality education such as interaction among students, parents and staff, along with a Training and Placement Cell ensures a bright future to its students. We strongly encourage innovation in research, in teaching and in service to the profession, the local community and industry. Our faculty and students are constantly striving to excel and to advance the state of the art in Computer Science and Engineering. I invite you to be part of our efforts as we propel the department of Computer Science & Engineering to ever-greater heights. In closing, I wish all the students and faculty a good academic career. Sincerely, and with best wishes,)
